                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-06"><hi rendition="#italic">April 6,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Everything indicates early passage bill to enforce award. Please send copies
                    United States statutes upon the subject.</p>
